Flask-Migrate (Alembic). Run as the schema owner:

    MIGRATE_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://shop_owner@.../shop flask db upgrade

The app's own role (DATABASE_URL) can't create or alter anything. Triggers, functions and
grants are written explicitly in the migrations, using sqlhelpers.py. Data migrations are
separate revisions from schema migrations. Every migration downgrades or says why not.
